OL,3,GNEWSAStolen rural equipment worth
OL,4,A#700,000 recovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force has recovered almost #700,000
OL,7,Fworth of stolen rural items after six
OL,8,Fmonths of patrols.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police's rural crime
OL,11,Faction team said the work was carried
OL,12,Fout between April and September across
OL,13,Fthe county.
OL,15,FThe stolen property included 11 cars
OL,16,Fworth more than #120,000, 13 pick-up
OL,17,Fvehicles valued at almost #217,000,
OL,18,Ffive items of plant machinery worth
OL,19,F#206,000 and three caravans worth more
OL,20,Fthan #46,000.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
