OL,3,GNEWSAStolen rural equipment worth
OL,4,A#700,000 recovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FSergeant Tom Nuttall, from the force,
OL,7,Fsaid: "These results highlight the
OL,8,Fbreadth of work undertaken by the team
OL,9,Fand our continued commitment to
OL,10,Fprotecting rural communities,
OL,11,Fdisrupting organised criminality and
OL,12,Fsupporting the wider policing response
OL,13,Facross the county."
